{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792309080, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T07:38:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T07:39:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792309140, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:38:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 66953, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "市政", "content": "想知道沈伯洋市長如何給台北人光榮感，我好幾個台中或高雄朋友都覺得是在地人，是很光榮的事，反觀台北人。", "display_name": "中正代表 金仔", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:38:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 65033, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我從小住在台北，因家境戶籍遷回南部阿嬤家，導致許多資源受戶籍限制，例如認養的狗，無法申請結紮補助等。", "display_name": "文山代表 No.65,033", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:38:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30608, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望法令能強制規定在十字路口處的騎樓內不可以停機車/腳踏車. 不僅行人不便，開車視線也會被遮住.", "display_name": "文山代表 No.30,608", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:38:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7702, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "市長我不是台北在地人，雖然這裡的公車很準時來的很快！但是公車司機開的太橫衝猛撞了，請讓司機有足夠時間", "display_name": "士林代表 No.7,702", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 65033, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.65,033", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 30608, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.30,608", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 7702, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.7,702", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 66954, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "display_n